# =============================================================================
# Utkarsha OS — lib/ubt/hci/hci.def — HCI commands, events and LE subevents
# =============================================================================
# The one source for HCI names, codes, versions and parameter layouts;
# gen_tables.py makes tables.asm from it, and the tests check the stack's
# own constants against it.
#
#   cmd  OPCODE  NAME  VERSION  PARAMETERS  |  RETURN
#   evt  CODE    NAME  VERSION  PARAMETERS
#   le   SUBCODE NAME  VERSION  PARAMETERS
#
# Layouts are field:size pairs separated by commas (sizes in bytes; "n" a
# variable part); "-" none; "?" not recorded here yet. VERSION is the
# Core specification that brought it.
# =============================================================================

